@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Inscription valide → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lucas@test.fr",
  "password": "motdepasse123"
}

### 2. Même email → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lucas@test.fr",
  "password": "motdepasse123"
}

### 3. Mot de passe trop court → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "autre@test.fr",
  "password": "abc"
}

### 4. JSON invalide → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "cassé@test.fr", }

### 5. Confirmation → 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lucas@test.fr",
  "code": "665538"
}

### 6. Code faux → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lucas@test.fr",
  "code": "000000"
}